Data flow	Explicit, synchronous, immutable-ish	Implicit, asynchronous (directives create the model)
Validation	Functions/validators in code, cross-field, async validators	Directive attributes (required, minlength)
Dynamic forms	Easy (FormArray, add/remove controls)	Hard
